USR0000092	DST0000478	5	If you're coming to Ho Chi Minh City, you must book a motorcycle food tour with Nancy and Cherry.This wasn't just a meal; it was an incredible journey through the heart of the city that I'll never forget.From the very beginning, Nancy was absolutely lovely.She has such a warm, genuine personality and went above and beyond to make us feel welcome.Riding a motorcycle in Saigon traffic can be intimidating, but Nancy was so professional and attentiveshe prioritized our safety at every turn, which allowed us to just relax and enjoy the breeze and the neon lights.The highlights of the tour: • The Food: Nancy made sure we were absolutely stuffed!We tried so many authentic dishes that we would never have found on our own.She didn't just order the food deep; she made sure we understood what we were talking about and we were enjoying. • Nancy Cherry had a great experience, so if you were able to eat and share the stories of the real world, they would be able to eat and talk about it, and they would be able to know each other.	2026-04-13 13:58:27.341+00	2026-04-13 13:58:27.341+00
USR0000094	DST0000478	5	We tried so many foods that were absolutely delicious, and Leonard was so knowledgeable about everything. I am a vegetarian and he made sure all the food was suitable for me which I really appreciated. It was a really fun and enjoyable experience!!	2026-04-13 13:58:28.711+00	2026-04-13 13:58:28.711+00
USR0000098	DST0000478	5	What an absolutely unforgettable experience. our street food tour was made truly special by Jennie and Harry  they were knowledgeable, funny, charismatic, and so warm and welcoming. from the very first stop, they made us feel completely at ease and brought the food, stories, and local culture to life in such a natural and engaging way. it felt less like a tour and more like being shown around by friends who genuinely love what they do. we're still talking about the food and the laughs. a huge credit to the business  we couldn't recommend this experience more highly.	2026-04-13 13:58:23.932+00	2026-04-13 13:58:23.932+00
USR0000099	DST0000478	5	What an incredible experience! Hanne and Vergil picked us up from our accommodation and brought us to meet Cong and Barry and their guests.Every member of the team was so welcoming, full of energy, and incredibly knowledgeable about every dish we tried.All 11 dishes were outstanding, and zipping through the city on scooters made the whole adventure feel magical.We loved seeing the sights, tasting unforgettable food, and exploring the hidden corners of Ho Chi Minh City that we would never have found on our own.Even in the wonderfully chaotic traffic, we felt completely safe on the bikes.The whole evening was packed with fun and easily one of the highlights of our trip so far.A special shout out to Hanne was an absolute friendly star!She, such a charismatic, and a fantastic ambassador for the company, made the tour truly exceptional.	2026-04-13 13:58:23.763+00	2026-04-13 13:58:23.763+00
